[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0010","text":"爱依酱……要轻一点哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0020","text":"OK……\n轻轻地……轻轻地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0030","text":"（？　两个人\n　在干什么呢……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0004","text":"在干什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0005","text":"（是想抓住\n　什么东西吗……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_00_0006","text":"（先看看\n　情况吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_01_0010","text":"啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_01_0020","text":"真是的，制作人\n都把它吓跑了啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_02_0010","text":"走你！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_02_0020","text":"哦，抓到了呢\n朝日酱！蝴蝶到手～♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_03_0010","text":"啊！制作人\n它往那边飞了，帮我抓住！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05090000_03_0020","text":"诶！？\n哪、哪里！？"}]
